{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03737","headline":"饯薛大夫护边 · 李峤","name":"饯薛大夫护边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒隅时未通，副相下临戎。\n授律星芒动，分兵月晕空。\n犀皮拥青橐，象齿饰雕弓。\n决胜三河勇，长驱六郡雄。\n登山窥代北，屈指计辽东。\n伫见燕然上，抽毫颂武功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}